---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout>
  <section class="plain-hero" aria-labelledby="home-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">MD Anik Hasan · Dhaka, Bangladesh</p>
    <h1 id="home-title">I build websites and custom software. I’m also building Boilabin.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      I’m an independent software builder and CSE student. I take on focused website and software
      projects, with public proof in native Windows software and practical automation.
    </p>
    <div class="actions" aria-label="Start a project">
      <a class="action action-primary" href="/hire/?service=website">Discuss a website</a>
      <a class="action" href="/hire/?service=software">Discuss custom software</a>
      <a class="text-link" href="/work/">View work</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="plain-section" aria-labelledby="foundation-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">Clean-room foundation</p>
    <h2 id="foundation-title">A clear service path before the workshop comes to life.</h2>
    <p>
      This first milestone establishes semantic HTML, verified facts, static rendering, strict
      TypeScript, and a provider-neutral build. The complete workshop system and substantive routes
      are added in the next milestones.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
